            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Use [its `get_location()` method](https://github.com/SmiteshP/nvim-navic/blob/8649f694d3e76ee10c19255dece6411c29206a54/doc/navic.txt#L37-L39) in [`MiniStatusline.config.content.active`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b21cd5b1b330844e4c4b93d65e99ecb7c79a63c9/doc/mini-statusline.txt#L144-L145). Use [default active content function](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b21cd5b1b330844e4c4b93d65e99ecb7c79a63c9/doc/mini-statusline.txt#L86-L106) as a starter and insert part from 'nvim-navic' where you see fit.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Use <a href=\"https://github.com/SmiteshP/nvim-navic/blob/8649f694d3e76ee10c19255dece6411c29206a54/doc/navic.txt#L37-L39\">its <code class=\"notranslate\">get_location()</code> method</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b21cd5b1b330844e4c4b93d65e99ecb7c79a63c9/doc/mini-statusline.txt#L144-L145\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MiniStatusline.config.content.active</code></a>. Use <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b21cd5b1b330844e4c4b93d65e99ecb7c79a63c9/doc/mini-statusline.txt#L86-L106\">default active content function</a> as a starter and insert part from 'nvim-navic' where you see fit.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Use its get_location() method in MiniStatusline.config.content.active. Use default active content function as a starter and insert part from 'nvim-navic' where you see fit.",
